  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes modern design software, prototyping tools, and asset management platforms:\n\n- **Core Design Software**: Figma, Figma Jam\n- **Prototyping & Motion**: Figma Interactive Components, Principle, ProtoPie\n- **User Research & Testing**: Maze, Lookback, UsabilityHub\n- **Design Tokens & Specs**: Tailwind CSS Color/Typography Tokens, Style Dictionary\n- **Asset Export & Handoff**: SVG, WebP, Lottie Animations, Figma Developer Mode\n\n---",
